    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Faculty at Aga Khan University have secured a  Grand Challenges Explorations grant  - funded by the Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation and the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative - aimed at spurring innovation in the diagnosis and treatment of novel strains causing infectious diseases in newborns.",
